{
 "ios-feedback|Progress indicators": {
  "summary": "A Plenix progress indicator on iOS is the system ProgressView (UIProgressView and UIActivityIndicatorView), kept native in behavior: it reports its value to VoiceOver, animates with the system, and respects Reduce Motion. Plenix changes the look to match the Web ProgressBar and Spinner: an 8-point pill track in the Plenix neutral fill with a fill in the tone color (info by default, success, warning or danger), a DM Sans label that names the task, an optional muted value in tabular digits, and a spinner in the Plenix primary action color. Determinate progress is used whenever the amount of work is known.",
